      "created_at": "2014-03-09T09:06:18.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I think you played correctly. It is similar to the situation when Plage Rat Ravages with only 1 target. you can be both highest and loest simultaneously, but you can't be the second highest if there's no one above you.</p>",
